[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7686.19, "timestamp": "02:08:06", "text": "是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7694.229, "timestamp": "02:08:14", "text": "正在发生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7698.03, "timestamp": "02:08:18", "text": "现在这里的情况并非如此，因为就像大多数情况一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7702.669, "timestamp": "02:08:22", "text": "人们都说，呃，碧昂丝也那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7721.95, "timestamp": "02:08:41", "text": "你们经常会看到这种情况，不仅仅是没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7725.87, "timestamp": "02:08:45", "text": "就在擂台上，是的，不止如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7728.709, "timestamp": "02:08:48", "text": "在以下情况下，这一点看得更清楚："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7729.99, "timestamp": "02:08:49", "text": "戒指"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7733.069, "timestamp": "02:08:53", "text": "场景但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7736.87, "timestamp": "02:08:56", "text": "嗯，我觉得对……来说也是一样的。"}]